id: pm-rl-cfqp
title: Converge the pinned pm-cli on 2026.8.31 and repair history hashes
description: "Converge the fleet on @unbrained/pm-cli 2026.8.31. pm-cli changed its history-hash computation between 2026.8.22 and 2026.8.24, so a repo whose history was written by an older pm reports history_drift_chain_mismatch when the pinned binary is bumped (upstream pm-cli#1168). The history is not corrupt; history-repair recomputes the hash fields under the new binary. The whole fleet converges on 2026.8.31 so every repo agrees."
