comments[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-31T16:38:54.115Z",pi-agent,"Pinned @unbrained/pm-cli to exactly 2026.8.31 (npm i --save-exact -D). Deleted .agents/pm/runtime/history-drift-cache.json before each health run. Pre health: history_drift ok, EXIT=0. Ran pm history-repair --all: scanned_streams 53, drifted_streams 0, repaired 0 (history already clean under 2026.8.31). Post health: history_drift ok, EXIT=0. git status shows only package.json, package-lock.json, and the gate/test changes -- no .agents/pm/history or .toon files changed, confirming no data loss."
